    "summary": "Cell papers are long-form, with a graphical abstract and highlights alongside the summary.\n\nDistilled requirements: Body up to 8,000 words; abstract up to 150 words; up to 7 figures; required sections: Introduction, Results, Discussion, Methods; APA citation style.\n\nAlso required: STAR Methods (Structured, Transparent, Accessible Reporting) required; Graphical abstract required (1200\u00d71200 px recommended); Highlights: 3\u20135 bullet points (85 characters each, max); Key Resources Table required in STAR Methods.\n\nThis summary is the app's distillation \u2014 open the author instructions above to confirm against the journal's current text.",
